WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.520
- I found out, you've
been married for 36 years?

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.784
- It'll be 37 in May.
- 30, wow!

00:00:04.784 --> 00:00:07.170
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.990
Like that's incredible.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:11.400
That's kind od unheard
of in this industry.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.790
How do you do it, how do you stay,

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.837
'cause I'm married, and
I love my husband truly,

00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:17.207
but there's still moments
where you're like,

00:00:17.207 --> 00:00:19.270
"You're driving me nuts."

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.420
And he has those plenty as well.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.030
- Well we just drive each other nuts,

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.931
and don't get divorced.
(audience laughs)

00:00:26.931 --> 00:00:29.416
- (laughs) Stitch that on pillow!

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:30.249
It's like--

00:00:30.249 --> 00:00:32.040
- Well we're, you know I
mean, a joke I always say

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.070
is we're both very stubborn,

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.990
and the only way out of
this is on the horizontal.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.060
- Oh my husband and I are
very stubborn as well.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:40.396
- Yeah, but you know, I
got lucky, I adore my wife.

00:00:40.396 --> 00:00:43.314
I met her first week of Freshman
year in college, you know?

00:00:43.314 --> 00:00:44.147
- [Kelly] Aw that's cool.

00:00:44.147 --> 00:00:45.410
- And we didn't go out right away,

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.514
which I was too, so too nervous and geeky,

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.040
no one would have gone out with me,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.650
but so we had a few years where we--

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.594
- You were too busy in the
stairwells singing with guys.

00:00:54.594 --> 00:00:55.427
(audience laughs)

00:00:55.427 --> 00:00:57.010
You're like--
- You know what's funny?

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.643
I met her in a stairwell!

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:01.701
(audience applauds)

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:03.340
- She was like, "Who's that guy singing?"

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:07.539
- It sounds like all I do
is hang out in stairwells.

00:01:07.539 --> 00:01:08.500
But look what happens.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.886
- You know what,
- There's magic

00:01:09.886 --> 00:01:10.719
in those stairwells.
- If you're single,

00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:12.320
and loo for love, find a stairwell

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.664
that doesn't look like a
Dateline special is gonna happen.

00:01:14.664 --> 00:01:15.990
Yes.
(audience laughs)

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.470
- She was going up, she
was coming down the stairs

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.720
to go out with some guy, and
I was going up the stairs

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.720
to see a girl, and we passed,
not a word was spoken.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.970
I remember to this day,
she had platform shoes on,

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:32.270
bell bottoms, tight, and the glitter belt.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:33.875
- I love her, yeah.
- It was a disco era!

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:37.800
And she is an amazing dancer,
and she would look so cool,

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.911
and I was like, oomp a
doomp a doomp a doomp.

00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:40.755
(audience laughs)

00:01:40.755 --> 00:01:43.610
And I just never, I
don't remember anything,

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:44.540
but I remember that.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.310
- That's so moving.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:48.130
I remember the first moment
I saw my husband too.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.043
- Do you, it's a nice--
- Yeah.

00:01:49.043 --> 00:01:50.440
- It's weird.
- Yeah, I felt like an energy,

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.662
it was like crazy, yeah.
- I know, it's weird.

00:01:51.662 --> 00:01:53.530
- People say that and
you're like, whatever.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:54.363
- Whatever, right.

00:01:54.363 --> 00:01:55.220
- Until you feel it and you're like,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:56.650
oh maybe it's real, okay.
- Whoa, maybe it's yeah.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:57.786
- Yeah, you're like,
- That's right.

00:01:57.786 --> 00:01:58.619
- All right, all right.

00:01:58.619 --> 00:02:00.230
- Okay, maybe there's something to that.

